# Product voice — human clinical English + UI budgets (always on)

Load `.cursor/skills/product-voice-no-hedge/SKILL.md` on all public caspro pages.

## Word budgets

Hero headline ≤8 words (no numbers/drugs) · subhead ≤20 · card body ≤22 · metric = 1 number + 3–5 word label. Study IDs / p-values / long regimens → **View Clinical Evidence** drawers only.

## Banned on main screen

`Door 1/2`, `Gate 0`, `SPE-high`, `on disk`, `UNCLEAR`, `frozen JSON`, `GSE*`, `TCGA-*`, `bioRxiv`, `AUROC`, `p =`, robotic em-dash templates, developer jargon.

Translate: dividing vs dormant tumor. Case switcher over walls of text.

## Execute

Over-budget or banned jargon → rewrite same turn. No permission theater.

## Still bound

No commit unless Alpha asks · no invented meters · no fabricated FDA clearance.
